From 7f52877b7fab4c6a9b4923cb876331a459fe7f2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:48:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(supplier): save and edit lorry hire details (type, PAN,
 default TDS, declaration, bank)

- Supplier create/update/delete logic moved to lib/supplier/service.ts (thin routes, same responses)
- Shared validator lib/supplier/extras.ts; older clients never wipe the new fields
- Case-insensitive duplicate names; rename refreshes ledger party names; delete blocked while a live contract uses the supplier
- Suppliers page: Type/PAN columns and a Lorry hire details section in the modal
- LHC form: a saved 194C(6) declaration starts the contract at 0% TDS
- Extract companyFilter into lib/company-filter.ts (re-exported) so data code is testable
- Tests: unit + MongoDB integration (skipped without TEST_MONGODB_URI)
